{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ec9ddb43-ea62-8700-803a-3ac1ad7a3df6",
  "created_at": "2025-12-17T17:27:27-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Patrick Cullen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:23:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:23:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes, um, I know it's after hours, City Hall's closed I think, but they said this number takes messages for the storm, so, I'm calling about a drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:23:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got the right place. We do monitor this line in the evenings when it's like this. What's going on with the drain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:23:51-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a grate at the curb out front, it's sunk down, gone down into the road, maybe three inches, and the water, it goes everywhere but down it. It runs right around it, across the sidewalk and into the neighbor's..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:24:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the grate itself has dropped below the level of the pavement?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:24:11-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, sunk. The street is higher around it now, so the water just, it goes past. This soaker today, it's been coming down since morning and there's a puddle out there now like a pond."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:24:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And can I get the address, or the nearest cross street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:24:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, um, I'd rather not say the address on the speaker here, I've got it on speakerphone, you understand. Can you just take the, the complaint?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:24:40-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can note it, but without a location the crew won't be able to find the grate. Is there a cross street or a landmark you'd be comfortable with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:24:51-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] No, I'll call back about that. I just wanted it put down that, that it's been like this a while. It's not new. I mentioned it to, well, it's been months, and nobody's come."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:25:05-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, that's aggravating, especially tonight. I'll write up the sunken grate and that it's been ongoing. When you call back with the location, it can get attached to the work order."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:25:18-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Because it's the kids, you see. They come down the street after school, and the dog walkers, and the water's right up in the road when the cars go by, and somebody's going to step in that and, and go down on the ice if it freezes tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:25:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a fair worry. If it freezes, that spot would be slick. Is the water deep, or just spread out wide?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:25:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wide. Across the whole bottom of the street almost. Deep at the grate, I couldn't say, I don't go out in it. Eighty-something, I'm not wading out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:25:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, definitely don't. Stay on the dry side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:26:01-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The street's dark too, but, there's one neighbor, wicked bright, the Christmas lights, you can see the whole puddle lit up like a, like a stage. Blue and white, they blink. So at least you can see the water, I'll say that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:26:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's one small help, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:26:21-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[crosstalk] Anyway. Do the crews, do they work on the weekend? Because if it's Thursday it stops and then nobody comes till, till Monday I'd guess."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:26:31-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After a storm like this they're stretched thin, and some work does go on over weekends, mostly emergencies and flooding that's a hazard. A sunken grate might be treated as routine, so I can't tell you the day. Getting the address in is what moves it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:26:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. Routine. It's been routine since the summer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:26:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Do you want to leave a callback number so someone can reach you for the location?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:27:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0184. Cullen, C-U-L-L-E-N, Patrick."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:27:04-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Patrick Cullen, 401-555-0184. I'll note sunken grate, water bypassing it, pedestrian concern, ongoing for months. And when you're ready, call this line with the address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:27:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will, I will. Thank you, dear. I just wish somebody'd, well..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:27:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I know. Keep warm tonight, and stay inside while it's pouring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T17:27:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Goodnight."
    }
  ],
